PRECONDITION — simulator reboot (why the sims were shut down and booted first):
  The unit suite contains startLive() tests that fire the REAL notification
  authorization request on the simulator. On a fresh sim the first such run
  leaves a pending SpringBoard "Would Like to Send You Notifications" alert
  that then appears in every app screenshot. Both lane sims were shut down
  and booted once to clear the pending alert before any frame was captured
  (a first capture pass that showed the alert was discarded, not committed;
  all committed frames come from the post-reboot pass below).

